  ui/border.ts:26 SplitBorder vertical "┃". Old code painted the ┃ text.muted.
- #3 marquee: Marquee::next_step_ms (marquee.rs) + session_tabs_solid::marquee_next_step;
  app.rs run loop wakes on the next 80ms boundary, pins store clock to it, plain
  100ms tick gated to never cross a boundary; select sleep = min(deadline-now,100).
