## Phase B — bug #2 (subagent click-to-switch), fixed
- ROOT CAUSES (two):
  1. oc-core engine/mod.rs subagent_plugin wired deps.progress = None —
     the real server NEVER published session.tool.progress for subagents,
     so the RUNNING card carried no metadata.sessionID (the TUI's
     tool_cell_hit NavigateToSession arms on it) — running cards were not
     clickable; completed cards were (success metadata via tool_execution).
     Also subagent.rs passed child.id as the tool id (v2 passes call.id).
     FIX: deps.progress publishes the ephemeral session.tool.progress with
     {sessionID(parent), assistantMessageID, id(call_id), metadata}.
     REF: /opt/opencode-ref/packages/core/src/tool/plugin/subagent.ts:201
     + src/session/runner/step.ts:96.
  2. The PICKER panel entries had NO pointer surface at all (KM wired only
     the transcript card). FIX: PickerEntryHits recorded per render
     (session.rs picker mount geometry), hover moves selection, release
     navigates. REF: subagents-tab.tsx:221-227.
- Navigation routing verified: select_tab → navigate → session_root family
  walk (root tab bookkeeping; route = the child; picker stays live on the
  child via parentID) — app test picker_entry_rows_hover_select_and_click_navigate.
- Gates: oc-core engine test (live bus subscription sees progress with
  id=call_sub_1, metadata.sessionID=child) PASS; oc-tui+oc-core 1668/1668 PASS.

## Phase C — bug #1 (omo-slim sidebar), fixed
- ROOT CAUSE: our ctx.ui.sidebar.setSection seam is an INVENTED API — the real
  omo-slim NEVER calls it. Its sidebar lives in the package's ./tui export
  (dist/tui2.js): tui(api) registers api.slots.register({order, slots:
  {sidebar_content: render}}) building OpenTUI trees via @opentui/{core,solid}
  + solid-js — packages the desktop host provides from its own module graph
  (absent from the npm install). Our host only loaded the ./server entry.
- FIX (host.js): load.tui + a TuiApi bridge (slots.register/ui.slot → the
  sidebar_content registry; host-pushed route/theme; renderer.requestRender →
  ui.slot.rerender; rejecting client stub). @opentui shims materialized into
  the install's node_modules (element records + EAGER insert; re-materialize
  is the reactive re-run). slot.materialize runs render() and flattens:
  row-join + column-stack → {title, rows}.
- FIX (supervisor): post-load ./tui companion probe; ui.slot.register/rerender
  → bounded slot.materialize → UiRequest::SidebarSection; 1s steady refresh.
- FIX (oc-tui): drain_ui_requests pushes tui.route + tui.theme notifications.
- REFS: tui2.js:31129-31131 (slots.register sidebar_content), :31051 (ui.slot
  append sidebar.content), renderSidebar :30646+ (the tree: header/config/
  preset/agent rows), @opencode-ai/plugin/dist/tui.d.ts (TuiPluginApi).
- PROOFS (real plugin staged from /root/.cache + OC_OMOS_ROOT/OC_OMOS_DEPS
  readable copies for the gate user):
  * oc-plugin-host flagship_sidebar: section lands — title "▼ OMO-Slim …",
    rows the REAL agent roster (with the machine preset: orchestrator
    glm-5.3, explorer glm-5.3-flash, …).
  * oc-tui pty_sidebar_real_omos_sections_render: renders in the LIVE pane
    (160 cols), roster rows under the header, clean exit ack.

